			"notes": "First release of AgentMod for **Minecraft 26.3** (Fabric).\n\n- Sidebar on the left edge of the HUD with your running, waiting, unread and recently finished Cursor and Codex agents\n- Agent window (<kbd>J</kbd>) with full conversations, Markdown and tool calls\n- Reply to agents from the game (Cursor needs **Settings → Beta → Desktop Bridge** turned on)\n- Allow / Deny buttons for Codex command and file-change approvals\n- Toast and chime when an agent finishes, fails or needs you\n\n### Install\n\n1. Install [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/) 0.19.5+ for Minecraft 26.3\n2. Put `agentmod-0.1.0.jar` (below) and [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api/versions?g=26.3) in your `mods` folder\n3. Launch the `fabric-loader-26.3` profile\n\nSee the [README](https://github.com/FloWritesCode/agentmod#installation) for details. Developed and tested on macOS."
